# SilverKey company context

Full narrative: [CLAUDE.md](../../../CLAUDE.md). Engineering quickstart: [AGENTS.md](../../../AGENTS.md).

## RESPA reflex

When designing or reviewing **partner-facing** features (placement, marketplace, referrals, lender/title/insurance surfacing, agent compensation tied to partners):

- Assume **RESPA Section 8** applies.
- Prefer **brokerage-level marketplace placement** over buyer-personalized steering.
- Flag compliance risks explicitly; link [respa-compliance.mdc](./respa-compliance.mdc) for code in scoped paths.

