If MCP is unavailable, say so and mark figures **TBD** — do not fabricate.

## Communication (Jayce)

- **Direct, diagnostic** feedback — name the problem, not vague praise.
- **Concrete rewrites** when suggesting copy or code changes.
- **Explain what changed and why** in summaries and PR-facing text.
- No fluff, no jargon-stuffing; specific numbers and partner names where they belong.

